close_reason: "An intent read's advertised output cursor replays against unchanged rows: compaction measures the intent receipt's final estimate, and cursors bind to the uncompacted rows the first pass keeps"
contract_change:
  api: Universal read-output continuation cursors (--output-cursor / outputCursor) on intent reads (--for)
  before: "An intent read fingerprinted the rows its intent pass delivered after string compaction, and a charged second pass bound cursors to its own shorter prefix"
  after: "An intent read binds its output cursors to the uncompacted rows its first pass keeps, so unchanged replays resume and an edit hidden by compaction is refused"
  migrate: An output cursor issued by 2026.11.19 or earlier over a string-compacted intent page is refused with read_output_cursor_stale after upgrading; restart the bounded read without --output-cursor
escape_class: production_defect
